`Instance.new` creates an object. `Window` is the class name, and the table supplies its starting properties. `Visible` initially defaults to false, so set it to true after creating the content.

Save the file. Run **LUI: Check Types**, then **LUI: Run App**.

**You should see:** an empty window titled **Hello, LUI**. Close it before continuing. [Download this checkpoint]({{Download:First-01-Window}}).

