`Parent = Window` puts the button inside the window. `Size` and `Position` use logical units. `UDim2.fromOffset` creates an offset-only size or position.

Save, check and run again. **You should see:** a **Say hello** button near the top-left. It has no action yet. [Download this checkpoint]({{Download:First-02-Button}}).

